  "worked_solution": "First, we can factor out the disjunction with $¬A,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n(B∨¬A)∧(¬C∨¬A)≡(B∧¬C)∨¬A\n$$\n\nThen, we can write\n\n$$\n(B∧¬C)∨¬A≡¬A∨(B∧¬C).\n$$",
